<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan refined zinc output off 5.3 pct y/y-MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan refined zinc output off 5.3 pct y/y-MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese refined zinc output in January fell 5.3 percent from the same month last year to 52,785 tonnes, according to preliminary Ministry of International Trade and Industry data released on Thursday.</p>
<p>The MITI data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		    Jan 96   yr/yr change   Dec 96</p>
<p> Output	   52,785     -5.3 pct     53,179</p>
<p> Shipments	53,888     +5.3 pct     50,693</p>
<p> Stocks	   55,629    -30.1 pct     54,105</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
